bluejetty:00035405:ios.description:
Shadow of the Depth is a top-down action roguelike set in a dark medieval fantasy world. You'll take on the role of a warrior, assassin, mage, and other characters as you navigate dungeons of light and shadow to root out the monsters that ravage your home. Be prepared to step into the depths before you!
The village where Arthur, the blacksmith's son, lived was overrun by a horde of monsters and ultimately engulfed in raging flames. Arthur's father was also taken from him in the bloodbath. From then on, Arthur embarked on this never-ending path of killing and revenge. However, he was not alone. Coincidentally, a swordsman, a hunter, a mage, and others ventured into this abyss filled with perilous monsters, setting off on their own adventure...
The game features:
- A killing spree with classic action roguelike elements;
- A heart-pounding battle with rhythmic combo mechanics;
- A lively group of playable characters with distinct abilities and fighting styles;
- 140+ passives combined with a talent and rune system to craft a personalized progression route;
- Randomized dungeons across three chapters, each featuring exhilarating boss battles;
- Dark, hand-drawn aesthetic enhanced by dynamic lighting effects that creates an immersive vibe;
- Stories that reveal the deeper secrets of the abyss;
- Single-player gameplay with smooth controller support.
Ready for a thrilling and one-of-a-kind journey into the unknown?
