bluejetty:00087993:ios.description:
Chinese Billiards Game,TianTian Billiards.An ultimate 8-ball and snooker billiards game!
1. Graphics and physics engine:
- The game simulates real graphics, table texture, light and shadow effects, as if taking you into a real billiard hall;
- Using the physics engine to simulate the movement trajectory, collision effect and rebound force of billiards, so that every shot is as real as in reality;
2. Various game modes:
- Classic 8ball battle: Real-time matching with global players to launch a fierce one-on-one competition. Here, you can use your superb skills and strategies to challenge all kinds of masters;
- Challenge mode: Hundreds of levels are designed, each with different difficulty levels. You need to use batting skills in various complex situations to complete tasks such as clearing the table and pocketing the designated ball.
- Snooker mode: Snooker gameplay brings players a more professional and strategic billiards experience, feel the unique charm of snooker, and challenge a single shot of 147;
3. Personalized dress-up:
- Powerful cues: The game provides a variety of cues, each with unique properties and appearance. You can improve the performance of the cue by strengthening it, making the shot more accurate;
- Personalized table: The game provides a variety of personalized tables, from simple and modern to retro and gorgeous, from cool sci-fi to classic wood, to meet your various aesthetic needs.

